The kettle is a fake container, open, openable, part of the tea-machine. The description is "The brass [as a noun]kettle[end as] is suspended from an [as a noun]arm-brace[end as] under the [as a noun]spigot[end as] and near the [as a noun]burner[end as]. [if full]It's full of [as a noun]water[end as].[end if]"

