The bracket is an open container, part of the tea-machine. The description is "Just below the main [as a noun]gear train[end as] is a semi-circular [as a noun]bracket[end as] made of silver[if the teacup is not in the bracket], unsurprisingly about the size of a [as a noun]teacup[end as].[otherwise if the teacup is empty], in which is a [as a noun]tea cup[end as] waiting for tea.[otherwise] in which is a nice full [as a noun]cup of tea[end as].[end if]"

