Part 2 - Parapet

Chapter 1 - Description

The Parapet is a exterior room. "[one of]I pick myself to my feet. [once only]A narrow lead-covered [as a noun]walkway[end as] along the cathedral [as a noun]roof[end as]. [one of]How clockwise can you be? [once only]It doesn't go anywhere, of course, but at least there're some [as a noun]gargoyles[end as] and things to stop me falling the rest of the way to the ground.[paragraph break]Off west a [as a noun]buttress[end as] flies out near the roof of a nearby Civil Service building."

Index map with Parapet mapped south of Minute Hand.

