	say "The [as a noun]Figure[end as] throws a glance over his shoulder before taking a flying leap off the [as a noun]buttress[end as]. It's incredible to watch – he's a like a grey squirrel, agile and totally fearless. I'm already exhausted – and he's off again, already!";

