The slated lead roof is a backdrop, in the Buttress and in the Parapet. "About five feet below – and five feet <Italic>away</Italic> – is the slated lead [as a noun]roof[end as] that almost touches the [as a noun]buttress[end as]." The printed name is "roof". Understand "next roof", "civil", "service", "building", "nearby", "slate" as the slated lead roof.

