The southern roof is backdrop, in rooftop 4 and in rooftop 5. "The [as a noun]roof[end as] on the other side of the [as a noun]alley[end as] seems to be littered with [as a noun]glass[end as] and [as a noun]piping[end as]. [if Weather Station is not visited]Who knows – maybe there's another [as a noun]ornithopter[end as] there, or a catapult or something.[end if]"

