Part 9 - Rooftop 5 (Narrow Chimney)

Chapter 1 - Description

The Rooftop 5 is a rooftop-area, east of Rooftop 4. "[one of]This [as a noun]roof[end as] is surrounded on all sides by taller buildings, scalable to the west, and impossible every other way. There's no [as a noun]roof[end as] at all to the southwest - the [as a noun]tiles[end as] look down on an alleyway  – but beyond that is the glitter of [as a noun]machinery[end as] (but it's too far to jump, I think).[or]This is a dead-end of high walls that I can only leave to the west. Southwest the roofs open out over an [as a noun]alleyway[end as] - beyond which I can see some [as a noun]machinery[end as] (but it's too far to jump).[stopping]"

The printed name is "Rooftop".

Instead of jumping in Rooftop 5:
	say "<Italic>Definitely</Italic> too far to [as a noun]jump[end as].";

Instead of going southwest in Rooftop 5:
	try jumping;

Instead of going southwest in Rooftop 5 when the vent is in the Weather Station:
