The glimpse-machine is a glimpse backdrop in the Grand Foyer. The printed name is the "[if the Difference Engine is admired][as a noun]Difference Engine[end as][else]machine[end if]". Understand "machine", "pinions", "difference", "engine", "computer" as the glimpse-machine.

Rule for printing the description of the glimpse-machine when in the Grand Foyer:
