	else if l is at most 3:
		say "But [one of]I can feel I'm close to asking about the [as a noun]Figure[end as][or]I don't need a machine to tell me this isn't going to find the [as a noun]Figure[end as][or]last time I saw the [as a noun]Figure[end as] he was in his [as a noun]ornithopter[end as] - but I need to tell the machine that[or]this doesn't quite feel right[at random].";
	else if l is 4:
		say "That seems very close - but not quite right!";


