The South Side is north of the Dank Alley. "The [as a noun]cobbles[end as] end here, replaced by wooden [as a noun]boards[end as] that crack and creak underfoot. The whole [as a noun]warehouse[end as] to the north must be built over the [as a noun]water[end as]: maybe they load things in from underneath." The printed name is "South Side of Warehouse".

