Chapter 1 - Description

Front Door is a room. South of the Front Door is east of South Side. The description of Front Door is "The front door of the [as a noun]warehouse[end as] has a sign: <Italic>462 Old Place. Pelagiac Holdings Corp, &c &n, Storage and Wares</Italic>. This is the place but I can't see any way in – the [as a noun]door[end as]'s locked by an [as a noun]iron bar[end as] I probably couldn't lift even if I could get the [as a noun]padlock[end as] off. Whatever's behind that must be worth a lot of money[one of]. (Of course, I know what's inside. According to the [as a noun]Difference Engine[end as] this cold and murky place is the lair of the [as a noun]Figure in Grey[end as].)[or].[stopping]".

Instead of going inside in Front Door: 
	try going west.

