Every turn when in Covalt's Bedroom and the third-state of Covalt is 1 during Midnight:
	say "[one of]The [as a noun]Figure[end as] seems taller again in the darkness. One gloved hand holds [as a noun]Covalt[end as] by the neck, a little way off the ground. 'Give me the [as a noun]Perpetuum[end as],' he hisses. 'Be assured, I will kill you for it!'[or][as a noun]Covalt[end as]’s eyes move – he’s seen me. But he doesn’t cry out. Then I realize: the [as a noun]Figure[end as] doesn’t know I’m here. I’ve got a chance to surprise him![or][as a noun]Covalt[end as] moves his eyes away from me, maybe so the [as a noun]Figure[end as] won’t catch my reflection in them.[or][desperately thinking loop][stopping]";

To say desperately thinking loop:
	say "[one of][or][as a noun]Covalt[end as] is looking past toward the corner of the room, where the [as a noun]birds[end as] are kept. [or]The [as a noun]birds[end as] in the [as a noun]cage[end as] are screeching manically. [cycling][one of]Think, Wren, think![or]If thinking doesn’t work, Wren, then do something![or]No time to lose![cycling]";

Instead of thinking when the third-state of Covalt is 1 during Midnight:
	say "I can't think - the [as a noun]birds[end as] are screaming in their [as a noun]cage[end as] so loudly."

Every turn when in Covalt's Bedroom and the third-state of Covalt is 2 during Midnight:
	fire TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_2A;

TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_2A is a trigger.

Rule for firing unfired TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_2A:
	say "[as a noun]Covalt[end as] is struggling, but I can see the fight coming back into his eyes. The [as a noun]Figure[end as] is clockwork, and [as a noun]Covalt[end as] <Italic>knows</Italic> about clockwork..."

Every turn when in Covalt's Bedroom and the third-state of Covalt is 2 during Midnight:
	fire TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_2;

TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_2 is a trigger.

Rule for firing fired TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_2:
	change the third-state of Covalt to 3;
	say "'You’re a machine,' [as a noun]Covalt[end as] growls. 'Just some two-bit machine run amok with gremlins in your gears.'[paragraph break]The [as a noun]Figure[end as]’s voice is impassive, just as it always has been. 'Better a machine than a feeble man.'[paragraph break]But [as a noun]Covalt[end as] grins, and the sight makes my heart soar with pride. 'Machines are fine,' he says. 'Till they need repairing. That’s when they come to me. When someone’s jammed something in their [as a noun]winding slot[end as] and snapped their spring.'";

TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_3 is a trigger.

Every turn when in Covalt's Bedroom and the third-state of Covalt is 3 during Midnight:
	fire TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_3;

Rule for firing fired TRIG_COVALT_FIGURE_3:
	change the third-state of Covalt to 4;
	say "'Now!' [as a noun]Covalt[end as] shouts. 'Jam something in, whatever you’ve got!'";

