Part 4 - Infrastructure for Noun Tagging

Before printing the name of an object when FyreVM is present:
	say "<noun>".
After printing the name of an object when FyreVM is present:
	say "</noun>".

To say as a noun -- beginning fyre_as:
	if FyreVM is present:
		say "<noun>".
To say as (O - an object) -- beginning fyre_as:
	if FyreVM is present:
		say "<noun wording='[the printed name of O]'>".
To say end as -- ending fyre_as:
	if FyreVM is present:
		say "</noun>".

